.git
.gitignore
**/.angular
**/dist
**/node_modules
**/target
**/*.log

# CN-009: the API image builds console/ itself, so its sources and the
# vendor/ tarballs npm ci needs must stay in the build context. The global
# patterns above already drop console/node_modules and console/dist (the
# image installs and builds them inside the console stage); these explicit
# entries keep that true if the global patterns change and also skip the
# Node test build output.
console/node_modules/
console/dist/
console/dist-test/
